 that butter all those  flavors all those juices that garlic  it's still in there don't waste it so  you're going to want to strain out take  out any of the super burnt bits leave  behind the fat and the juices combine  that you know with some flour with some  beef stock and some other things and  kind of cook it over heat until it gets  nice and thick into a sauce so that's  gonna be the gravy for the prime rib um  it's pretty awesome and you can season  as you go when i was making this video  actually it was pretty late i think it  was like even a weekend where it was  just the super expensive huge chunk of  rib eye and i really did not want to  mess it up and i was very scared i was  gonna you know make it you know mess it  up and have to spend more money to get  it right and it is an expensive cut so  make sure that you do treat it well if  you have a meat thermometer that'll save  you a lot of headache into knowing if  it's cooked or not you want to aim for  around 130 to 135 if you're going for  medium rare anything higher than that is  just more well done and my favorite part  is just really just it's that reveal  it's when you first get that nice thick  slice out of there and the whole thing  just comes out it's juicy it's pink it's  perfectly cooked you plate it with some  nice mashed potatoes you plate it with  some nice vegetables you support some  gravy you kind of drench it in gravy for  me and that's pretty much it you kind of  go ham you go in and you try not to get  a second slice but knowing me i'm gonna  get like three slices so yeah if you do  make it let me know send over pictures  ask me questions it's you know one of my  favorite recipes of all time we've ever  made on tasty one of the proudest i've  ever been happy to help you guys out and  i just want you guys to enjoy your steak  as much as i do  making these recipes is is honestly it's  not just fun but i think allows me to do  a lot of things that i do currently in  life and have done before it is  something that i enjoy it when i'm able  to make other people happy by giving  them food because that makes me happy  and making tasty videos is essentially  being able to make hundreds and  thousands and if not millions of people  happy in a certain way and i think  that's just pretty awesome so if you do  make it let me know i really love seeing  when people make and i think it's just  pretty awesome  [Music]  [Music]  you

